 Description
 
 Follow on from https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14926
 
 Evaluating persistent authentication changes needs a clear setup path and a way to isolate the
 experiment. This PR adds guided setup, developer evaluation tools and debug-only keyring isolation.
 
 Layer 8 of an eight-part prototype review stack. This is a way to review the design and
 implementation in smaller pieces, not a proposal to merge the current stack as-is.
